"""Prism: a presentation-only preview of the existing Pilot-50 dashboard.

Deploy this file from a branch created from ``pilot-50-dashboard``. Keep the
original ``streamlit_app.py``, ``src/``, ``config/`` and ``outputs/`` in place.

The original local app remains the content authority. A small AST loader pauses
it before ``bundle = get_bundle()``, replaces only presentation helpers, and
then executes its original navigation and page dispatch. No network code loader,
scientific recomputation, source-file writes, or shared-module monkeypatching.

Decorative artwork is cropped from the design references supplied by the user.
It is confined to the header/sidebar, never to a research image or graph.

Inspected branch: pilot-50-dashboard
Inspected commit: 125ea5653026ca5a17ccd991f8ef2d1f1363b62d
Original app Git blob: 9643b46bc54bc252a5cd93d30f64a00e894d619e
"""

from __future__ import annotations

import ast
import hashlib
import html
import json
